OL,3,GNEWSADog walkers poo bag fines
OL,4,Aconsidered by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog walkers could face fines for
OL,7,Ffailing to carry poo bags, under new
OL,8,Fplans being considered by an East
OL,9,FSussex council.
OL,11,FHastings Borough Council's cabinet will
OL,12,Fdecide on Monday whether to extend the
OL,13,Ftown's Dog Control Public Space
OL,14,FProtection Order (PSPO) for three
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
