OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADog walkers poo bag fines
OL,4,Aconsidered by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as renewing current
OL,7,Frestrictions including ordering owners
OL,8,Fto keep dogs on leads on the promenade
OL,9,Fand clearing up dog fouling, cabinet
OL,10,Fwill also be asked to add a new
OL,11,Fcondition which would make it an
OL,12,Foffence "to not have a suitable means
OL,13,Fto remove dog faeces".
OL,15,FA report to the cabinet said the change
OL,16,Fwould be seen as a preventative
OL,17,Fmeasure, and "should not be viewed as
OL,18,Fgenerating a large amount of fixed
OL,19,Fpenalty notices".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
